# Navigate from main_screen to gameplay
# Use with: MILO_FIRST_SCREEN=main_screen MILO_INPUT_SCRIPT=native/test_assets/gameplay_nav.input
#
# Flow: main_screen → choose_mode → song_select → select song → MoveOn → ready/game
# Key: on song_select, confirm on a SONG (not a header) triggers
#      SongSortNode::OnSelect() → MoveOn() → move_on_quickplay

# main_screen: DANCE is first item (focused by default)
30 confirm

# choose_mode_screen: "perform" is first item
120 confirm

# song_select_screen: list has tier headers first, need to scroll to a song
# Navigate down past header items to reach an actual song
250 down
260 down
270 down
280 down
290 down

# confirm on a song triggers Select() → MoveOn()
350 confirm

# difficulty select: "Beginner" is first item
450 confirm

# multiuser_screen: confirm player setup
520 confirm

# loading/ready screens
580 start
640 confirm

# practice_welcome_screen: "Full Song Session" (practice_all) is default/first option
# Confirm to advance to game_screen with dance HUD
700 confirm

# extra confirms in case of additional intermediate screens
800 confirm
860 start
920 confirm
